    "text": "LIVE\nUpdated 44 min ago\nStocks to Watch: SpaceX, Intel, BMW\n↘️ SpaceX (SPCX): After three days of gains since its IPO, shares in Elon Musk's company are wavering between gains and losses. Still, it's the most actively traded stock by dollar volume on the Nasdaq.\n↗️ JPMorgan Chase (JPM): Shares of the nation's largest bank advanced 1.5%, putting it in position to close at an all-time high for the first time since early January.\n↗️ Intel (INTC), Broadcom (AVGO), Micron Technology (MU): The stocks are recovering some lost ground after the PHLX Semiconductor index of chip stocks had its second-worst day of the year yesterday.",
